{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 13,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A wise son ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "heareth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his father’s instruction;\nBut a scoffer heareth not rebuke.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man shall eat good by the fruit of his mouth;\nBut the soul of the treacherous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall eat",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " violence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that guardeth his mouth keepeth his life;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that openeth wide his lips shall have destruction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The soul of the sluggard desireth, and hath nothing;\nBut the soul of the diligent shall be made fat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A righteous man hateth lying;\nBut a wicked man is loathsome, and cometh to shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Righteousness guardeth him that is upright in the way;\nBut wickedness overthroweth the sinner.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is that maketh himself rich, yet hath nothing:\nThere is that maketh himself poor, yet hath great wealth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The ransom of a man’s life is his riches;\nBut the poor heareth no threatening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The light of the righteous rejoiceth;\nBut the lamp of the wicked shall be put out.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By pride cometh only contention;\nBut with the well-advised is wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wealth gotten by vanity shall be diminished;\nBut he that gathereth by labor shall have increase.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hope deferred maketh the heart sick;\nBut when the desire cometh, it is a tree of life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso despiseth the word bringeth destruction on himself;\nBut he that feareth the commandment shall be rewarded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The law of the wise is a fountain of life,\nThat one may depart from the snares of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Good understanding giveth favor;\nBut the way of the transgressor is hard.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every prudent man worketh with knowledge;\nBut a fool flaunteth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A wicked messenger falleth into evil;\nBut a faithful ambassador is health.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Poverty and shame ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be to",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " him that refuseth correction;\nBut he that regardeth reproof shall be honored.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The desire accomplished is sweet to the soul;\nBut it is an abomination to fools to depart from evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Walk with wise men, and thou shalt be wise;\nBut the companion of fools shall smart for it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evil pursueth sinners;\nBut the righteous shall be recompensed with good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A good man leaveth an inheritance to his children’s children;\nAnd the wealth of the sinner is laid up for the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Much food ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the tillage of the poor;\nBut there is that is destroyed by reason of injustice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that spareth his rod hateth his son;\nBut he that loveth him chasteneth him betimes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.13.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.13.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous eateth to the satisfying of his soul;\nBut the belly of the wicked shall want.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
